‎
‎## 6. Migration Without Announcement — The Crossroads Connection
‎
‎> Evaluation headstarts choice. An inhabitant doesn't need to announce "I am migrating to a new ecosystem."
‎
‎Migration pattern:
‎
‎**This is how forest inhabitants survive.**
‎
‎Not by debating the new ecosystem, but by quietly starting to live in it.
‎
‎**Field Instrument:**
‎Watch what inhabitants *do* when forest changes — not what they *say* about it.
‎
‎- Who is already using AI to generate boilerplate?
‎- Who is already verifying instead of writing?
‎- Who has already relocated up the stack?
‎
‎That is early signal of migration.
